	<section_number>6.2-1357</section_number>
	<catch_line>Qualifications of officials</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every officer, director, and committee member shall be a member of the credit union.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 6-213; 1956, c. 90; 1966, c. 584, § 6.1-204; 1968, c. 560; 1990, c. 373, § 6.1-225.40; 2010, c. 794.</history>
